nBu Yay\u0131nda Sizi Neler Bekliyor?\n\nSon Dakika Haberleri: T\u00fcrkiye ve d\u00fcnyadan anl\u0131k, s\u0131cak geli\u015fmeler.\n\nEkonomi ve Siyaset: Alan\u0131nda uzman konuklarla derinlemesine analizler ve piyasa yorumlar\u0131.\n\n\u00d6zel Dosyalar ve R\u00f6portajlar: Perde arkas\u0131nda kalan ger\u00e7ekleri g\u00fcn y\u00fcz\u00fcne \u00e7\u0131karan yay\u0131nlar.\n\nG\u00fcndem Yaratan Tart\u0131\u015fmalar: Sans\u00fcrs\u00fcz, cesur ve halk\u0131n sesini yans\u0131tan programlar.\n\nHaberi kayna\u011f\u0131ndan, tarafs\u0131z ve do\u011fru bir \u015fekilde \u00f6\u011frenmek i\u00e7in S\u00f6zc\u00fc Televizyonu canl\u0131 yay\u0131n\u0131ndan ayr\u0131lmay\u0131n. Ger\u00e7ekleri sadece burada izleyeceksiniz!\n\nT\u00fcrkiye g\u00fcndeminden an\u0131nda haberdar olmak i\u00e7in kanal\u0131m\u0131za abone olmay\u0131 ve bildirim zilini (\ud83d\udd14) a\u00e7may\u0131 unutmay\u0131n. Canl\u0131 yay\u0131n\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 be\u011fenerek ve d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcncelerinizi canl\u0131 sohbette/yorumlarda payla\u015farak tart\u0131\u015fmaya kat\u0131l\u0131n.\n\nS\u00f6zc\u00fc Televizyonu'nu nas\u0131l izleyebilirsiniz?\n\nDigiturk: 60\nD-smart: 93\nTurkcell TV Plus: 69\nTivibu: 69\nT\u00fcrksat Kablo TV: 76\nT\u00fcrksat 4A: 11837 Frekans, 30.000 V, bat\u0131, fec:2/3\n\nSosyal Medya Hesaplar\u0131m\u0131z;\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Sozcutelevizyonu\nhttps://www.instagram.com/sozcutelevizyonu/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/sozcutelevizyonu\nhttps://twitter.com/szctelevizyonu\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@sozcutelevizyonu\n\n#canl\u0131yay\u0131n #canl\u0131 #s\u00f6zc\u00fctv", "channel_id": "UCOulx_rep5O4i9y6AyDqVvw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOulx_rep5O4i9y6AyDqVvw", "view_count": 359401903, "average_rating": null, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ztmY_cCtUl0", "categories": ["News & Politics"], "tags": ["s\u00f6zc\u00fc tv canl\u0131 izle", "s\u00f6zc\u00fc tv canl\u0131", "canl\u0131 tv izle", "tv